PSN Sichterman, Gerhart. Promotie; Velsen, Johannes van. Drukker/uitgever; Lammers, Gerhard. Overige functies; Pagenstecher, Alexander Arnoldus. Overige functies
TIT Miles togatus sive Carmina gratulatoria dicata genio et meritis doctissimi & strenuissimi viri juvenis dn. Gerardi Sichterman in principis Arausionensium & Nassaviae &tc. &tc. &tc. cohorte praetoria locum tenentis cum post 5, thesium controversarum decades publice defensas in choro templi academ. ex auctoritate rectoris magnifici dn. Gerh. Lammers med. & philos. doct. & prof. ord. &tc. et amplissimi senatus academici consensu, & excellentissimae facultatis iuridicae decreto promotore viro excellentissimo, celeberrimo dn. A.A. Pagenstecher jc. in academia Groning-Oml. juris publ. & priv. prof. ord, ejusdemque facultatis decano &tc. &tc. a.d. 13. ian. 1707. more majorum adhibitis togae, pilei, annuli, libri aperti & clausi, ceterisque solennibus in numerum juris utriusque dd. cooptaretur & orationem elegantiss. de Marte conjugendo pronunciaret.
